00:47:33.060 --> 00:47:34.100
El marketing model

00:47:34.100 --> 00:47:36.020
separa la venta en dos partes.

00:47:36.620 --> 00:47:38.560
La venta base, que ocurría de todas

00:47:38.560 --> 00:47:40.460
formas, y el aporte de cada

00:47:40.460 --> 00:47:42.480
